  "description": "## What's New in v4.3.0\n\n### New Model: GPT-5.2 Codex\n- Added Gpt5_2Codex (gpt-5.2-codex) for agentic coding tasks\n- Reasoning effort: low/medium(default)/high/xhigh (no 'none')\n\n### Claude Haiku 4.5 Extended Thinking\n- Extended thinking now supported on Claude Haiku 4.5\n- New SupportsExtendedThinking public property on ClaudeService\n\n### Test Improvements\n- AIServiceException.ErrorDetails logging in test framework\n- Relaxed streaming assertions for multilingual responses\n\n## Supported Models\n\n### Anthropic Claude\n- Claude Opus 4.6, Opus 4.5, Opus 4.1, Opus 4\n- Claude Sonnet 4.6, Sonnet 4.5, Sonnet 4\n- Claude Haiku 4.5\n\n### OpenAI\n- GPT-5, GPT-5 Mini, GPT-5 Nano, GPT-5 Chat Latest\n- GPT-5.1\n- GPT-5.2, GPT-5.2 Pro, GPT-5.2 Codex\n- o3, o3-pro\n- GPT-4.1, GPT-4.1 Mini, GPT-4.1 Nano\n- GPT-4o, GPT-4o Mini, GPT-4 Vision\n\n### Google Gemini\n- Gemini 2.5 Pro, Flash, Flash-Lite\n- Gemini 3 Pro Preview, Flash Preview\n\n### DeepSeek\n- DeepSeek Chat, DeepSeek Reasoner\n\n### Perplexity\n- Sonar, Sonar Pro, Sonar Reasoning\n\n## Documentation\n- Basic Usage: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia/wiki\n- Advanced Features: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia/wiki/Advanced-Features\n- Release Notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia/wiki/Release-Notes\n- GitHub: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia",
